@startuml On the Road

title On the road: progress marks, crossings, fuel and border refusals
caption Target design. Decisions X2, O20, O27, O18, X10, P14, O2, O28, O5, O1. ADRs 0016, 0015, 0005, 0010.

autonumber

actor "Convoy Leader" as leader
actor "Other drivers" as drivers
actor Dispatcher as disp
participant "Checklist page\n(phone, nothing stored)" as page
participant "Freedom API" as api
database "Freedom database" as db

leader -> drivers : directions by radio
note right of drivers
  Other drivers are not given route or destination details (O1).
end note

== Reaching a route point or accommodation ==
leader -> page : mark "reached"
page -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/route/{point}/reached
api -> db : check caller leads **this** convoy now
api -> db : RoutePointMark (recorded by, entered time)
note right of api
  No GPS, no live tracking.
  HQ sees progress only from these marks (O20).
end note

== Crossing a border ==
leader -> page : mark border "crossed"
page -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/route/{point}/crossed
group one transaction
  api -> db : RoutePointMark (Crossed)
  api -> db : that authority's accepted declarations -> **Closed**
end
note right of api
  A closed declaration is frozen: later load changes
  no longer make it stale.
end note

== No signal: the Dispatcher records it on the leader's behalf ==
leader -> disp : phone or radio report: "we crossed"
disp -> api : POST .../crossed
api -> db : mark recorded by the Dispatcher, named (O27)
note right of disp
  If the page is unavailable, the leader calls HQ
  and works from printed documents (O18).
end note

== Fuel ==
leader -> page : enter fuel spent
page -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/costs (Fuel)
api -> db : actual cost under the leader's name (P14)

== Customs refuse a box ==
alt customs keep it
  leader -> api : box outcome **Seized**
else customs send it back
  leader -> api : box outcome **Returned to hub** (leader picks a registered hub)
  api -> db : box back to Arrived at that hub, label and contents unchanged
else damaged or stolen
  leader -> api : box outcome **Undeliverable**, with reason
end
api -> db : box leaves the vehicle's load
note right of api
  The vehicle's still-open declarations go stale,
  raising a re-declare task for the Dispatcher.
end note

@enduml
